From c780736fa32d106e18938ea0b760f5848160ea93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:18:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] safety: rework hondaRlxForwarder as a three-bus bridge
 with a powertrain tap

The bridge panda now keeps intercepting the RLX LKAS camera like a
regular Honda harness (camera on bus 2, EPS on bus 0) and taps the
powertrain bus on bus 1:

  camera (2) -> EPS (0): everything but the camera's 0x194/0x33D
  EPS (0) -> camera (2): everything but STEER_STATUS/CAR_SPEED, which
                         are routed to the powertrain bus (1) instead
  powertrain (1) -> EPS (0): openpilot's STEERING_CONTROL and LKAS_HUD

Forwarding to/from bus 1 is not possible with the fixed 0 <-> 2 pair, so
safety_hooks gains an optional fwd_bus hook that lets a mode choose the
destination bus per message. Modes that don't set it are unchanged.

Co-authored-by: mliza <mliza@umass.edu>
